          "script": "\tgoodTxt = self.view.custom.good\n\ttry:\n\t\tg = int(goodTxt) if goodTxt not in (None, \"\") else 0\n\texcept (ValueError, TypeError):\n\t\tg = 0\n\tmaxH = self.view.params.maxHeadroom\n\tself.view.custom.overHeadroom = (maxH is not None and g > maxH)\n\tself.emitRowChanged()"
        },
        {
          "name": "emitRowChanged",
          "params": [],
          "script": "\tc = self.view.custom\n\tlines = []\n\tfor d, q in ((c.scrap1Defect, c.scrap1Qty), (c.scrap2Defect, c.scrap2Qty), (c.scrap3Defect, c.scrap3Qty), (c.scrap4Defect, c.scrap4Qty), (c.scrap5Defect, c.scrap5Qty), (c.scrap6Defect, c.scrap6Qty)):\n\t\tif d is not None and q not in (None, ''):\n\t\t\tlines.append({'defectCodeId': d, 'quantity': q})\n\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage('dieCastRowChanged', payload={\n\t\t'lotId': self.view.params.lotId,\n\t\t'good': c.good,\n\t\t'scrapLines': lines,\n\t}, scope='page')"
        },
        {
          "name": "applyScrap",
          "params": [],
          "script": "\t# FAT #23: scrap auto-decrements Good. Sum the submittable scrap (reason +\n\t# qty both present, matching emitRowChanged's line filter), subtract only the\n\t# DELTA vs what was already applied from the CURRENT Good -- so operator hand-\n\t# edits to Good survive and reducing/clearing a scrap adds the pieces back.\n\tc = self.view.custom\n\ttotal = 0\n\tfor d, q in ((c.scrap1Defect, c.scrap1Qty), (c.scrap2Defect, c.scrap2Qty), (c.scrap3Defect, c.scrap3Qty), (c.scrap4Defect, c.scrap4Qty), (c.scrap5Defect, c.scrap5Qty), (c.scrap6Defect, c.scrap6Qty)):\n\t\tif d is not None:\n\t\t\tqi = BlueRidge.Common.Util.toIntOrNone(q)\n\t\t\tif qi:\n\t\t\t\ttotal += qi\n\tapplied = BlueRidge.Common.Util.toIntOrNone(c.scrapApplied) or 0\n\tg = BlueRidge.Common.Util.toIntOrNone(c.good) or 0\n\tg = g - (total - applied)\n\tif g < 0:\n\t\tg = 0\n\tself.view.custom.good = str(g)\n\tself.view.custom.scrapApplied = total\n\tself.applyGood()"
        }
